1
00:00:00,310 --> 00:00:03,140
(Sheldon:)...and then returned it to me,
hoping I wouldn't notice.

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:06,900
(Sheldon:)Would you characterize that
as responsible?

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,770
(Page:)That's really not the sort of
thing we're interested in.

4
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:13,070
(Sheldon:)You heard me say
Blu-ray, right?

5
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,610
(Leonard:)I did.

6
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:15,810
(Sheldon:)Very well.

7
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:17,110
(Sheldon:)Would you be interested

8
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:20,450
(Sheldon:)in knowing that Mr. Wolowitz
once snuck onto

9
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:23,450
(Sheldon:)my World of Warcraft account
and changed the name

10
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:28,320
(Sheldon:)of a certain level-80 warlock
from Sheldor to Smeldor?

11
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:29,890
(Page:)I'm afraid not.

12
00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:32,090
(Page:)Is there anything else?

13
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:33,090
"Is there anything else?"

14
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:34,260
(Sheldon:)Where would you like to start?

15
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,990
(Sheldon:)He refuses to pay fines

16
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,930
(Sheldon:)when he's overdue
with books I lend him.

17
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:40,970
(Sheldon:)He crashed the Mars Rover while
attempting to impress a woman.

18
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:42,500
(Sheldon:)He recommended that I go see

19
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:45,100
the third Matrix movie
because it was, and I quote,

20
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:48,520
"just as good
as the first one."

21
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:51,980
(Sheldon:)If that's not irresponsible,
I don't know what is.

22
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:59,020
(Page:)The Mars Rover?

